# UI Merge Acceptance

Merge / 收尾验收时，**截图和交互都要给用户看**。口头 “done” 不算。

## Required deliverables (merge / task complete)

1. **Screenshot** — key surfaces at 390×844 (usually 1–3 stills, not every micro-edit)
2. **Interaction** — show the motion/feel: scroll, snap, click-through, hover, open console, enter `/sound`, etc. as relevant

## Interaction how

Prefer one of:
- Short browser walkthrough with snapshots at interaction points (scroll → snap → click → land)
- 录屏 path if available; otherwise sequential screenshots of the interaction states
- Name the clicks/scrolls explicitly: e.g. “scroll past dock → hub → Metal & Pages click → `/updates`”

## Still vs interaction cadence

| Moment | What to show |
|--------|----------------|
| Mid-work tweaks | Optional; skip noise |
| One visual intent done | 1 still of that surface |
| **Merge / “好了吗” / 验收** | Stills **+** interaction proof |

## Capture basics

- `http://localhost:3000/` · viewport **390×844** · Esc close overlays
- Navigate → wait → capture (no race)
- `Read` images into chat

## Fail condition

UI merge/验收 reply with only text, or only stills and no interaction proof = incomplete.
